# Generated migrations land here (config.migrationsDir) as timestamped
# `<UTC timestamp>_<name>.sql` files — e.g. 20240101000000_add_account_status.sql —
# matching the Supabase `supabase/migrations` convention.
#
# The sample tests render into an isolated temp directory instead of committing a
# generated `-- supaschema: lineage` artifact, so this directory stays empty.
